  "description": "An idiomatic, immutable, fluent C# wrapper over Kookerella.FsWordDsl - build and read Word documents (.docx/.dotm) from C# without touching F# discriminated unions or option types directly. Unlike libraries that only build or mutate a document through an imperative API, this can also decompile an existing .docx/.dotm into idiomatic, runnable C# source that rebuilds it (CsCodeGen.Generate) - read a real document, get back the code that builds it. Covers every feature the F# core models: paragraphs and runs, named styles, numbered/bulleted lists, tables, images, hyperlinks, bookmarks, comments, sections and page setup, headers/footers, document protection, footnotes/endnotes, track changes, content controls, and VBA (as opaque bytes).",
